{"text":"Back home, on your mom's nightstand, there's a photo: you, five years old, on your dad's shoulders, in front of that same T. rex skeleton. Your dad helped dig it up, in North Dakota, before you were born. You haven't let yourself think about him since you got here. Tonight you do. When you were small, your dad used to put you to bed under his dinosaur posters. He dug up fossils for a living.","mood":"sad","settings":{"stability":0.4,"style":0.7,"speed":1.02},"alignment":{"characters":["B","a","c","k"," ","h","o","m","e",","," ","o","n"," ","y","o","u","r"," ","m","o","m","'","s"," ","n","i","g","h","t","s","t","a","n","d",","," ","t","h","e","r","e","'","s"," ","a"," ","p","h","o","t","o",":"," ","y","o","u",","," ","f","i","v","e"," ","y","e","a","r","s"," ","o","l","d",","," ","o","n"," ","y","o","u","r"," ","d","a","d","'","s"," ","s","h","o","u","l","d","e","r","s",","," ","i","n"," ","f","r","o","n","t"," ","o","f"," ","t","h","a","t"," ","s","a","m","e"," ","T","."," ","r","e","x"," ","s","k","e","l","e","t","o","n","."," ","Y","o","u","r"," ","d","a","d"," ","h","e","l","p","e","d"," ","d","i","g"," ","i","t"," ","u","p",","," ","i","n"," ","N","o","r","t","h"," ","D","a","k","o","t","a",","," ","b","e","f","o","r","e"," ","y","o","u"," ","w","e","r","e"," ","b","o","r","n","."," ","Y","o","u"," ","h","a","v","e","n","'","t"," ","l","e","t"," ","y","o","u","r","s","e","l","f"," ","t","h","i","n","k"," ","a","b","o","u","t"," ","h","i","m"," ","s","i","n","c","e"," ","y","o","u"," ","g","o","t"," ","h","e","r","e","."," ","T","o","n","i","g","h","t"," ","y","o","u"," ","d","o","."," ","W","h","e","n"," ","y","o","u"," ","w","e","r","e"," ","s","m","a","l","l",","," ","y","o","u","r"," ","d","a","d"," ","u","s","e","d"," ","t","o"," ","p","u","t"," ","y","o","u"," ","t","o"," ","b","e","d"," ","u","n","d","e","r"," ","h","i","s"," ","d","i","n","o","s","a","u","r"," ","p","o","s","t","e","r","s","."," ","H","e"," ","d","u","g"," ","u","p"," ","f","o","